291
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:49,920
Who dash into a burning building to save

292
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:52,560
a family trapped inside. These are

293
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:54,720
people who run toward danger when most

294
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:57,000
of us freeze or run away.

